<title>BELGIUM: Belgian CFE 1996 profit halves.</title>
<headline>Belgian CFE 1996 profit halves.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	     156  vs   222</p>
<p>    Group net profit	    134  vs   252</p>
<p>    Cons current profit	 117  vs   394</p>
<p>    Cons operating profit     326  vs   416</p>
<p>    Cons turnover(billions) 21.34  vs 24.32</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)     203  vs   240</p>
<p>NOTE - CFE is a Belgian civil engineering and construction group with worldwide interests.</p>
<p>In a statement, the group said that, on the basis of current orders, it expected 1997 results to be slightly better than in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
